msgstr "O kò gba laaye láti ṣàtúnṣe Stripe webhooks."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:34
msgid ""
"That key does not look like a Stripe key for the selected mode. Copy a "
"restricted key that starts with rk_, or a secret key that starts with sk_."
msgstr ""
"Bọtini yẹn kò jọ bọtini Stripe fún irú ti a yan. Daakọ bọtini to ni àkóso "
"ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu rk_, tàbí bọtini asiri ti o bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹlu sk_."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:44
msgid ""
"Webhook is active and the signing secret is saved. The key you pasted was "
"not stored, so you can delete it in Stripe now."
msgstr ""
"Webhook ti wa ni iṣe ati pe àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Bọtini ti o "
"lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:49
msgid ""
"Webhook events were updated. The key you pasted was not stored, so you can "
"delete it in Stripe now."
msgstr ""
"Àwọn iṣẹlẹ webhook ti ṣe àtúnṣe. Bọtini ti o lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han kò ti "
"fipamọ́, nítorí náà, o le pa a ni Stripe bayii."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:56
#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-maybe-handle-stripe-webhook-setup.php:47
msgid ""
"That webhook endpoint already existed, so Stripe did not return a signing "
"secret. Open the endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard, copy the signing "
"secret, and paste it below."
msgstr ""
"Ẹnu-ọna webhook yẹn ti wa tẹlẹ, nítorí náà Stripe kò dá àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si "
"padà. Ṣí ẹnu-ọna naa ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ, daakọ àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si, ki o si "
"lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi han ní isalẹ."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:69
msgid ""
"A Stripe signing secret starts with whsec_. Copy it again from the webhook "
"endpoint in your Stripe Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si Stripe bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú whsec_. Daakọ rẹ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si láti "
"ẹnu-ọna webhook ní Dashboard Stripe rẹ."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:77
msgid ""
"Signing secret saved. Send a test event from Stripe to confirm that your "
"site accepts it."
msgstr ""
"Àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ti fipamọ́. Rán iṣẹlẹ ìdánwò láti Stripe láti jẹ́risi pé "
"ojú-ìtà rẹ gba a."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-handle-manual-webhook-setup.php:83
msgid "Paste a Stripe key or a signing secret before you save."
msgstr "Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si fi bọtini Stripe tàbí àkọsílẹ fọwọ́si ṣáájú ki o tó fipamọ́."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-maybe-handle-stripe-webhook-setup.php:30
msgid ""
"This connected account cannot update webhooks automatically. Paste a "
"restricted key with Webhook endpoints: Write, or create the endpoint in "
"Stripe yourself."
msgstr ""
"Àkọọlẹ ti a so pọ̀ yìí kò le ṣe àtúnṣe awọn webhook laifọwọyi. Lẹ́ẹ̀kan si "
"fi bọtini to ni àkóso pẹ̀lú Ìbèèrè Webhook: Kọ, tàbí ṣẹda ẹnu-ọna ní Stripe "
"fúnra rẹ."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-maybe-handle-stripe-webhook-setup.php:41
msgid "Stripe webhook is configured for the selected mode."
msgstr "Webhook Stripe ti wa ni tunto fun ipo ti a yan."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-sync-stripe-webhook-for-mode.php:9
msgid "Cannot configure webhooks without a Stripe secret key for the active mode."
msgstr "Kò le tunto awọn webhooks laisi bọtini aṣiri Stripe fun ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-sync-stripe-webhook-for-mode.php:14
msgid ""
"Stripe cannot reach local-only webhook URLs (like .test/.local). Use a "
"public tunnel URL for webhook testing, or use Stripe CLI forwarding while "
"testing locally."
msgstr ""
"Stripe kò le de ọdọ awọn URL webhook ti agbegbe nikan (gẹgẹbi "
".test/.local). Lo URL ikanni gbogbogbo fun idanwo webhook, tabi lo ikanni "
"Stripe CLI ni akoko idanwo agbegbe."

#: admin/settings/templates/stripe-webhook-settings-sync-stripe-webhook-for-mode.php:83
msgid ""
"This connected account token cannot manage webhooks automatically. Please "
"create the webhook manually in Stripe dashboard for the active mode."
msgstr ""
"Bọtini akọọlẹ ti a so pọ ko le ṣakoso awọn webhooks laifọwọyi. Jọwọ ṣẹda "
"webhook naa ni ọwọ ni dashboard Stripe fun ipo ti n ṣiṣẹ."

